        "source":  "Anthropic News",
        "url":  "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-economic-index-connector",
        "date":  "2026-07-22",
        "theme":  "Enterprise",
        "summary":  "Anthropic launched a connector for Claude that enables users to explore data from the Anthropic Economic Index directly through conversations. The tool allows people to ask questions about AI adoption across industries and occupations, with Claude providing answers grounded in actual usage patterns. The datasets and connector are freely accessible to researchers, journalists, policymakers, and the general public.",
        "execSummary":  "Anthropic has turned its AI adoption dataset into a live conversational tool, allowing any enterprise leader to query real-world AI usage patterns by industry and occupation without needing a data analyst. This is a practical intelligence resource for benchmarking your organization\u0027s AI adoption pace against sector peers and identifying where your function is ahead or behind the curve. It also signals that adoption telemetry is becoming a strategic asset ΓÇö one that AI providers will increasingly use to shape product roadmaps and policy narratives. Customer support and operations leaders should query it to understand how AI is reshaping their function across the broader market.",
