        "summary":  "Drawing on the Deloitte AI Institute\u0027s 2026 State of AI report, the article finds that 74% of enterprises plan to deploy agentic AI within two years, yet only 21% have a mature governance model in place. It argues that non-human identities ΓÇö agents, tools, and models ΓÇö are becoming more numerous than human identities in modern enterprises, creating an expanding and underprotected attack surface. The proposed solution is a centralized control plane that governs agent permissions, policies, and observability across the organization.",
